        "on_start_battle party recording",
        "Battle construction/prepare/clear rules",
        "pbEnsureParticipants sparse able counts and side-size sync",
        "pbSetUpSides unfiltered wild iteration",
        "AI objects and command scan all slots",
        "full priority by configured max index",
        "attack and entering effects consume priority"
      ],
      "premises": [
        "Default ordinary core, no plugin/override/variant/partner/debug, player has one able non-egg member",
        "Already constructed ordinary non-egg CATERPIE objects P/Q with no item; P HP0, Q current HP=totalHP; no form/start/enter handler rewrites HP or membership. This is an explicit finite author-input fixture, not a claim normal generated encounters contain fainted wild members.",
        "Requested callbacks/logging/resource and scene setup prior to observation normal; no inferred real host result",
        "For mixed facet, no mutation alters input membership/order or ability/HP after ensure; action processors return normally"
      ],
      "facets": [
        {
          "id": "ZERO_ABLE",
          "normal_control": "一个已有非蛋野生P、HP>0；可战计数项1，默认1v1参与校验通过。",
          "minimal_counterexample": "只改同一P为HP0；非空参与数组通过构造，可战数组无第一项，原相等1/1两侧被缺项替换；首次玩家侧按布局枚举时报一般异常，早于invalid-owner/has-no-able、建席、正常场景开始与专用中止捕获。",
          "derived_observation": "开战前玩家记录已写、创建规则已清；没有正常布尔/结果返回、无本次正常终局保证。不能将该源异常理想化为友好空野生错误。"
        },
        {
          "id": "MIXED_ORDER",
          "normal_control": "已有野生对象有序[Q可战,P HP0]：原2/2同步1/1，Q在席1属于0..1排序范围。",
          "minimal_counterexample": "只把输入顺序改[P HP0,Q可战]：同样布局同步1/1；仍建P席1/Q席3，Q在场活着但max索引1，全量动作序无Q。AI对象/命令可以覆盖席3，普通攻击扫描依然只使用priority，不给Q常规行动。",
          "derived_observation": "入场统一处理同样按速度priority过滤，Q不在该集合；野生开场显示和显式wild钩子另有前序。普通目标解析/UI视觉、未审AI细节及完整终局不由此断言。"
        }
      ],
